<!--
    Strings for new handwritten Compose screens (owner decision Q14), in Material sentence case (Q13).
    The Skip-generated Conclave library module has no resource source set, so its Kotlin resolves these by name
    at run time through conclaveString() in Sources/Conclave/Skip/ui/theme/ConclaveStrings.kt. Rename a string
    only together with its call sites; a Swift source test checks that every referenced name exists here.
    Numbers in visible text follow the device locale, except counts that scripts parse (the clipped text, match
    and tap readouts): those arrive as ASCII strings (%1$s), so they read the same in every locale (TG 4.1).
-->
